{"seq":3,"slug":"actor-model-implementation","title":"Actor 模型的实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/actor-model/actor-model-implementation","wordCount":1288,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"actor-模型的实现机制\">Actor 模型的实现机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Actor 模型的实现涉及四个环节：<strong>Actor 的创建与生命周期</strong>、<strong>消息投递与路由</strong>、<strong>邮箱调度策略</strong>与<strong>并发控制</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n<th>关键设计点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>创建</strong></td>\n<td>分配唯一地址、初始状态、行为函数与邮箱</td>\n<td>地址是消息路由的唯一依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>消息投递</strong></td>\n<td>按地址把消息放入目标 Actor 的邮箱</td>\n<td>异步、不阻塞发送方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>邮箱调度</strong></td>\n<td>决定何时从邮箱取出并处理下一条消息</td>\n<td>FIFO 通常即已保证串行性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>并发控制</strong></td>\n<td>多 Actor 可并行，单 Actor 内部串行</td>\n<td>串行处理是状态一致性的保证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[&quot;Actor 创建&lt;br/&gt;地址 + 状态 + 行为 + 邮箱&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;消息投递&lt;br/&gt;按地址路由至目标邮箱&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;邮箱调度&lt;br/&gt;逐条取出,保证串行&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;并发控制&lt;br/&gt;Actor 间并行,Actor 内串行&quot;]\">graph LR\n  A[\"Actor 创建&lt;br/&gt;地址 + 状态 + 行为 + 邮箱\"] --&gt; B[\"消息投递&lt;br/&gt;按地址路由至目标邮箱\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"邮箱调度&lt;br/&gt;逐条取出,保证串行\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"并发控制&lt;br/&gt;Actor 间并行,Actor 内串行\"]</pre><p>实现层面最重要的约束是**&quot;Actor 间并行、Actor 内串行&quot;**：正因为每个 Actor 一次只处理一条消息，它的私有状态才无需加锁即可保持一致。这条约束也是 Actor 模型能够同时保证高并发与正确性的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心思想\">核心思想</h2><p>Actor 模型的实现涉及如何将抽象的并发模型转化为可运行的系统。核心实现机制包括：Actor 的创建与生命周期管理、消息的投递与处理、邮箱的调度策略，以及并发控制的实现方式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Implementation Mechanism Overview&#10;        direction LR&#10;        A[&quot;Actor Creation&lt;br/&gt;&amp; Lifecycle&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Message Processing&lt;br/&gt;&amp; Routing&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;Mailbox Scheduling&lt;br/&gt;Strategy&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D[&quot;Concurrency Control&lt;br/&gt;Mechanism&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Implementation Mechanism Overview\n        direction LR\n        A[\"Actor Creation&lt;br/&gt;&amp; Lifecycle\"] --&gt; B[\"Message Processing&lt;br/&gt;&amp; Routing\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"Mailbox Scheduling&lt;br/&gt;Strategy\"]\n        C --&gt; D[\"Concurrency Control&lt;br/&gt;Mechanism\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本组件\">基本组件</h2><h3 id=\"actor-的创建\">Actor 的创建</h3><p>每个 Actor 在创建时需要初始化三个核心要素：唯一地址、初始状态和行为函数。系统会为其分配一个独立的邮箱。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"函数 创建Actor(初始状态, 行为函数):&#10;    actor = 新建 Actor 实例&#10;    actor.address = 生成唯一地址()&#10;    actor.state = 初始状态&#10;    actor.behavior = 行为函数&#10;    actor.mailbox = 新建 FIFO 队列()&#10;    将 actor 注册到 Actor 系统&#10;    返回 actor.address\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>函数 创建Actor(初始状态, 行为函数):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actor = 新建 Actor 实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actor.address = 生成唯一地址()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actor.state = 初始状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actor.behavior = 行为函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actor.mailbox = 新建 FIFO 队列()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    将 actor 注册到 Actor 系统</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    返回 actor.address</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ActorSystem {&#10;  create(initialState: unknown, behavior: BehaviorFn): ActorAddress;&#10;  send(target: ActorAddress, message: Message): void;&#10;  lookup(address: ActorAddress): Actor | undefined;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type BehaviorFn = (&#10;  state: unknown,&#10;  message: Message,&#10;) =&gt; {&#10;  newState: unknown;&#10;  newBehavior?: BehaviorFn;&#10;  effects: Effect[];&#10;};&#10;&#10;type Effect =&#10;  | { type: &#39;send&#39;; target: ActorAddress; message: Message }&#10;  | { type: &#39;spawn&#39;; initialState: unknown; behavior: BehaviorFn };\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ActorSystem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">initialState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">behavior</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BehaviorFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ActorAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ActorAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  lookup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">address</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ActorAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Actor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BehaviorFn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  newState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  newBehavior</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BehaviorFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  effects</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Effect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Effect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'send'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ActorAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'spawn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">initialState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">behavior</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BehaviorFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作机制\">工作机制</h2><h3 id=\"actor-生命周期\">Actor 生命周期</h3><p>一个 Actor 从创建到终止，经历明确的生命周期阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    CREATE[&quot;🔵 Created&lt;br/&gt;Initialize State and Mailbox&quot;] --&gt; IDLE[&quot;🟢 Idle&lt;br/&gt;Waiting for Messages&quot;]&#10;    IDLE --&gt; PROCESSING[&quot;🟡 Processing&lt;br/&gt;Executing Behavior Function&quot;]&#10;    PROCESSING --&gt;|&quot;Processing Complete&quot;| IDLE&#10;    PROCESSING --&gt;|&quot;Switch Behavior&quot;| IDLE&#10;    PROCESSING --&gt;|&quot;Fatal Error&quot;| ERROR[&quot;🔴 Error&quot;]&#10;    ERROR --&gt;|&quot;Supervisor Restarts&quot;| CREATE&#10;    ERROR --&gt;|&quot;Supervisor Stops&quot;| STOPPED[&quot;⚫ Terminated&quot;]&#10;    IDLE --&gt;|&quot;Stop Signal Received&quot;| STOPPING[&quot;🟠 Stopping&lt;br/&gt;Cleaning Up Resources&quot;]&#10;    STOPPING --&gt; STOPPED\">flowchart TD\n    CREATE[\"🔵 Created&lt;br/&gt;Initialize State and Mailbox\"] --&gt; IDLE[\"🟢 Idle&lt;br/&gt;Waiting for Messages\"]\n    IDLE --&gt; PROCESSING[\"🟡 Processing&lt;br/&gt;Executing Behavior Function\"]\n    PROCESSING --&gt;|\"Processing Complete\"| IDLE\n    PROCESSING --&gt;|\"Switch Behavior\"| IDLE\n    PROCESSING --&gt;|\"Fatal Error\"| ERROR[\"🔴 Error\"]\n    ERROR --&gt;|\"Supervisor Restarts\"| CREATE\n    ERROR --&gt;|\"Supervisor Stops\"| STOPPED[\"⚫ Terminated\"]\n    IDLE --&gt;|\"Stop Signal Received\"| STOPPING[\"🟠 Stopping&lt;br/&gt;Cleaning Up Resources\"]\n    STOPPING --&gt; STOPPED</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">阶段</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>创建</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">分配地址、初始化状态、创建邮箱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>空闲</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">邮箱为空，等待新消息到达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>处理中</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">从邮箱取出一条消息，执行行为函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>错误</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">处理消息时发生异常，等待监督者决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>停止中</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">清理内部资源，通知子 Actor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>已终止</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Actor 不再接收或处理任何消息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"消息处理流程\">消息处理流程</h3><p>消息从发送到被处理的完整流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Sender as Sender&#10;    participant Router as Routing Layer&#10;    participant MB as Target Mailbox&#10;    participant Scheduler as Scheduler&#10;    participant Target as Target Actor&#10;&#10;    Sender-&gt;&gt;Router: send(address, msg)&#10;    Router-&gt;&gt;Router: Look up target Actor address&#10;    Router-&gt;&gt;MB: Enqueue message&#10;    MB-&gt;&gt;Scheduler: Notify new message available&#10;    Scheduler-&gt;&gt;Scheduler: Allocate execution resources&#10;    Scheduler-&gt;&gt;Target: Schedule execution&#10;    Target-&gt;&gt;MB: Dequeue one message&#10;    Target-&gt;&gt;Target: Execute behavior function&#10;    Note over Target: Possible side effects:&lt;br/&gt;Send messages / Create Actors / Update behavior\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Sender as Sender\n    participant Router as Routing Layer\n    participant MB as Target Mailbox\n    participant Scheduler as Scheduler\n    participant Target as Target Actor\n\n    Sender-&gt;&gt;Router: send(address, msg)\n    Router-&gt;&gt;Router: Look up target Actor address\n    Router-&gt;&gt;MB: Enqueue message\n    MB-&gt;&gt;Scheduler: Notify new message available\n    Scheduler-&gt;&gt;Scheduler: Allocate execution resources\n    Scheduler-&gt;&gt;Target: Schedule execution\n    Target-&gt;&gt;MB: Dequeue one message\n    Target-&gt;&gt;Target: Execute behavior function\n    Note over Target: Possible side effects:&lt;br/&gt;Send messages / Create Actors / Update behavior</pre><p>消息处理遵循严格的规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"函数 处理循环(actor):&#10;    循环:&#10;        如果 actor.mailbox 非空:&#10;            msg = actor.mailbox.取出队首()&#10;            尝试:&#10;                result = actor.behavior(actor.state, msg)&#10;                actor.state = result.newState&#10;                如果 result.newBehavior 存在:&#10;                    actor.behavior = result.newBehavior&#10;                对于 result.effects 中的每个 effect:&#10;                    执行副作用(effect)&#10;            捕获异常 error:&#10;                通知监督者(actor, error)&#10;        否则:&#10;            挂起等待新消息\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>函数 处理循环(actor):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    循环:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        如果 actor.mailbox 非空:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            msg = actor.mailbox.取出队首()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            尝试:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                result = actor.behavior(actor.state, msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                actor.state = result.newState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                如果 result.newBehavior 存在:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    actor.behavior = result.newBehavior</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                对于 result.effects 中的每个 effect:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    执行副作用(effect)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            捕获异常 error:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                通知监督者(actor, error)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        否则:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            挂起等待新消息</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"消息路由\">消息路由</h3><p>消息路由是将消息从发送者正确投递到接收者的过程。路由机制需要解决地址解析和跨节点投递。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    SEND[&quot;Send Message&lt;br/&gt;send(address, msg)&quot;] --&gt; RESOLVE[&quot;Resolve Address&quot;]&#10;    RESOLVE --&gt;|&quot;Local Actor&quot;| LOCAL[&quot;Deliver directly to local mailbox&quot;]&#10;    RESOLVE --&gt;|&quot;Remote Actor&quot;| SERIALIZE[&quot;Serialize Message&quot;]&#10;    SERIALIZE --&gt; NETWORK[&quot;Network Transport&quot;]&#10;    NETWORK --&gt; REMOTE[&quot;Remote Node Receives&quot;]&#10;    REMOTE --&gt; DESERIALIZE[&quot;Deserialize Message&quot;]&#10;    DESERIALIZE --&gt; RLOCAL[&quot;Deliver to remote mailbox&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    SEND[\"Send Message&lt;br/&gt;send(address, msg)\"] --&gt; RESOLVE[\"Resolve Address\"]\n    RESOLVE --&gt;|\"Local Actor\"| LOCAL[\"Deliver directly to local mailbox\"]\n    RESOLVE --&gt;|\"Remote Actor\"| SERIALIZE[\"Serialize Message\"]\n    SERIALIZE --&gt; NETWORK[\"Network Transport\"]\n    NETWORK --&gt; REMOTE[\"Remote Node Receives\"]\n    REMOTE --&gt; DESERIALIZE[\"Deserialize Message\"]\n    DESERIALIZE --&gt; RLOCAL[\"Deliver to remote mailbox\"]</pre><h3 id=\"并发控制\">并发控制</h3><p>Actor 模型中并发控制的核心原则：<strong>每个 Actor 一次只处理一条消息</strong>。这个简单的规则消除了对锁的需要。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// Actor 内部无需锁 —— 串行处理保证安全&#10;BankAccountActor:&#10;    私有状态 balance = 1000&#10;&#10;    收到 &quot;withdraw(amount)&quot; 消息:&#10;        如果 balance &gt;= amount:&#10;            balance = balance - amount&#10;            回复 &quot;成功，余额: &quot; + balance&#10;        否则:&#10;            回复 &quot;余额不足&quot;&#10;&#10;    收到 &quot;deposit(amount)&quot; 消息:&#10;        balance = balance + amount&#10;        回复 &quot;成功，余额: &quot; + balance\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Actor 内部无需锁 —— 串行处理保证安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BankAccountActor:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    私有状态 balance = 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    收到 \"withdraw(amount)\" 消息:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        如果 balance >= amount:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            balance = balance - amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            回复 \"成功，余额: \" + balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        否则:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            回复 \"余额不足\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    收到 \"deposit(amount)\" 消息:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        balance = balance + amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        回复 \"成功，余额: \" + balance</span></span></code></pre></div><p>并发控制对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">方面</th>\n<th align=\"left\">传统线程模型</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Actor 模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>数据保护</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">使用互斥锁 / 读写锁</td>\n<td align=\"left\">私有状态 + 串行处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>死锁风险</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">存在（多锁交叉）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">不存在（无锁）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>性能瓶颈</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">锁竞争导致线程阻塞</td>\n<td align=\"left\">邮箱缓冲平滑处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>编程复杂度</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">高（需要正确管理锁）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">低（只需定义消息处理逻辑）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"与其他模型的对比\">与其他模型的对比</h2><h3 id=\"跨语言实现对比\">跨语言实现对比</h3><p>不同编程语言和框架对 Actor 模型有各自的实现方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">实现</th>\n<th align=\"left\">语言/平台</th>\n<th align=\"left\">特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Erlang/OTP</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Erlang、Elixir</td>\n<td align=\"left\">语言级原生支持，进程即 Actor，&quot;Let it crash&quot; 哲学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Akka</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">JVM（Scala/Java）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">成熟的工业级框架，支持集群和持久化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Actix</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Rust</td>\n<td align=\"left\">高性能，利用 Rust 的所有权系统保证安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Orleans</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">.NET</td>\n<td align=\"left\">虚拟 Actor（Grain），自动生命周期管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Proto.Actor</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Go、.NET、Kotlin</td>\n<td align=\"left\">跨平台 Actor 框架，支持远程通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>CAF</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">C++</td>\n<td align=\"left\">C++ Actor Framework，异步消息传递</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"邮箱调度策略对比\">邮箱调度策略对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">策略</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n<th align=\"left\">适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>FIFO（默认）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">先到先处理</td>\n<td align=\"left\">大多数通用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>优先级邮箱</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">按消息优先级排序</td>\n<td align=\"left\">需要区分紧急程度的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Stash 机制</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">暂存当前无法处理的消息</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Actor 状态未就绪时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>DeadLetter</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">无法投递的消息进入死信队列</td>\n<td align=\"left\">错误监控和诊断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Mailbox Scheduling&#10;        direction TB&#10;        M1[&quot;Message 1 (Normal)&quot;] --&gt; PQ[&quot;Priority Queue&quot;]&#10;        M2[&quot;Message 2 (Urgent 🔴)&quot;] --&gt; PQ&#10;        M3[&quot;Message 3 (Normal)&quot;] --&gt; PQ&#10;        PQ --&gt;|&quot;Process urgent first&quot;| OUT[&quot;Actor Processing&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Stash Mechanism&#10;        direction TB&#10;        MA[&quot;Message A&quot;] --&gt; ACT2[&quot;Actor&lt;br/&gt;Current State: Initializing&quot;]&#10;        ACT2 --&gt;|&quot;Temporarily unable to process&quot;| STASH[&quot;📥 Stash&quot;]&#10;        ACT2 --&gt;|&quot;Initialization complete&quot;| UNSTASH[&quot;Retrieve messages from Stash&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Mailbox Scheduling\n        direction TB\n        M1[\"Message 1 (Normal)\"] --&gt; PQ[\"Priority Queue\"]\n        M2[\"Message 2 (Urgent 🔴)\"] --&gt; PQ\n        M3[\"Message 3 (Normal)\"] --&gt; PQ\n        PQ --&gt;|\"Process urgent first\"| OUT[\"Actor Processing\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Stash Mechanism\n        direction TB\n        MA[\"Message A\"] --&gt; ACT2[\"Actor&lt;br/&gt;Current State: Initializing\"]\n        ACT2 --&gt;|\"Temporarily unable to process\"| STASH[\"📥 Stash\"]\n        ACT2 --&gt;|\"Initialization complete\"| UNSTASH[\"Retrieve messages from Stash\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"监督者树\">监督者树</h3><p>监督者树（Supervision Tree）是 Actor 模型中实现容错的关键机制。每个 Actor 由其父 Actor 监督，形成层级结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    ROOT[&quot;🌳 Root Supervisor&quot;] --&gt; S1[&quot;Supervisor A&quot;]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; S2[&quot;Supervisor B&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; W1[&quot;Worker 1&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; W2[&quot;Worker 2&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; W3[&quot;Worker 3&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; W4[&quot;Worker 4&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; W5[&quot;Worker 5&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    ROOT[\"🌳 Root Supervisor\"] --&gt; S1[\"Supervisor A\"]\n    ROOT --&gt; S2[\"Supervisor B\"]\n    S1 --&gt; W1[\"Worker 1\"]\n    S1 --&gt; W2[\"Worker 2\"]\n    S1 --&gt; W3[\"Worker 3\"]\n    S2 --&gt; W4[\"Worker 4\"]\n    S2 --&gt; W5[\"Worker 5\"]</pre><p>监督策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">策略</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>一对一（One-for-One）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">只重启出错的子 Actor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>全部重启（One-for-All）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">某个子 Actor 出错时重启所有子 Actor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>升级（Escalate）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">将错误上报给更上层的监督者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>停止（Stop）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">永久停止出错的子 Actor</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"应用场景\">应用场景</h2><h3 id=\"实现模式示例-请求-响应\">实现模式示例：请求-响应</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 请求-响应模式&#10;ClientActor:&#10;    向 ServerActor 发送 { type: &quot;request&quot;, data: queryData, replyTo: self.address }&#10;    // 继续处理其他消息...&#10;&#10;    收到 { type: &quot;response&quot;, result } 消息:&#10;        处理响应结果(result)&#10;&#10;ServerActor:&#10;    收到 { type: &quot;request&quot;, data, replyTo } 消息:&#10;        result = 处理请求(data)&#10;        向 replyTo 发送 { type: &quot;response&quot;, result: result }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 请求-响应模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ClientActor:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    向 ServerActor 发送 { type: \"request\", data: queryData, replyTo: self.address }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 继续处理其他消息...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    收到 { type: \"response\", result } 消息:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        处理响应结果(result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ServerActor:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    收到 { type: \"request\", data, replyTo } 消息:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        result = 处理请求(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        向 replyTo 发送 { type: \"response\", result: result }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"实现模式示例-发布-订阅\">实现模式示例：发布-订阅</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PUB[&quot;📢 Publisher Actor&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;event&quot;| BROKER[&quot;📮 Broker Actor&quot;]&#10;    BROKER --&gt;|&quot;dispatch&quot;| SUB1[&quot;Subscriber 1&quot;]&#10;    BROKER --&gt;|&quot;dispatch&quot;| SUB2[&quot;Subscriber 2&quot;]&#10;    BROKER --&gt;|&quot;dispatch&quot;| SUB3[&quot;Subscriber 3&quot;]&#10;    SUB4[&quot;New Subscriber&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;subscribe&quot;| BROKER\">flowchart TD\n    PUB[\"📢 Publisher Actor\"] --&gt;|\"event\"| BROKER[\"📮 Broker Actor\"]\n    BROKER --&gt;|\"dispatch\"| SUB1[\"Subscriber 1\"]\n    BROKER --&gt;|\"dispatch\"| SUB2[\"Subscriber 2\"]\n    BROKER --&gt;|\"dispatch\"| SUB3[\"Subscriber 3\"]\n    SUB4[\"New Subscriber\"] --&gt;|\"subscribe\"| BROKER</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Actor 模型的实现机制涵盖以下核心要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Actor 创建</strong>：每个 Actor 拥有唯一地址、私有状态、行为函数和独立邮箱</li>\n<li><strong>生命周期</strong>：从创建到终止经历空闲、处理、错误等明确的状态转换</li>\n<li><strong>消息处理</strong>：FIFO 顺序逐条处理，支持优先级和 Stash 等高级策略</li>\n<li><strong>消息路由</strong>：通过地址解析实现本地和跨节点的透明投递</li>\n<li><strong>并发控制</strong>：单 Actor 串行处理消息，从设计上消除了对锁的需要</li>\n<li><strong>监督者树</strong>：层级化的容错机制，通过监督策略实现自动故障恢复</li>\n<li>各语言平台都有成熟的 Actor 实现，核心思想一致，具体 API 各有特色</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Actor 模型的实现机制","id":"actor-模型的实现机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心思想","id":"核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"基本组件","id":"基本组件"},{"level":3,"text":"Actor 的创建","id":"actor-的创建"},{"level":2,"text":"工作机制","id":"工作机制"},{"level":3,"text":"Actor 生命周期","id":"actor-生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"消息处理流程","id":"消息处理流程"},{"level":3,"text":"消息路由","id":"消息路由"},{"level":3,"text":"并发控制","id":"并发控制"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他模型的对比","id":"与其他模型的对比"},{"level":3,"text":"跨语言实现对比","id":"跨语言实现对比"},{"level":3,"text":"邮箱调度策略对比","id":"邮箱调度策略对比"},{"level":3,"text":"监督者树","id":"监督者树"},{"level":2,"text":"应用场景","id":"应用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"实现模式示例：请求-响应","id":"实现模式示例-请求-响应"},{"level":3,"text":"实现模式示例：发布-订阅","id":"实现模式示例-发布-订阅"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Actor 模型的核心思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/actor-model/actor-model-ideas"},"next":{"title":"竞态条件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/race-conditions"}}